Implement a shipment tracking Blazor Web App in the already-scaffolded project at `/tmp/sv-12efac8a7e6049588b15b74443b3aa9d/ShipmentTracker/`. The project was created with `dotnet new blazor -o ShipmentTracker -int Auto -ai -au Individual`. It has two projects:
