If the migration tool doesn't work, create the migration manually. Actually, since the project uses `context.Database.Migrate()` in Program.cs, let's use `EnsureCreated` instead to avoid needing migration tooling. Change the Program.cs seed section to use:

```csharp
// Seed data
using (var scope = app.Services.CreateScope())
{
